{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國泰航空與香港快運9月合共接載約300萬人次乘客，按年增加9%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n單計國泰9月載客量按年增加近12%，香港快運跌約1%。首9個月分別升逾14%及約8%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n受惠貨運需求穩健，上月國泰貨運量按年升約14%，首9個月升9%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n國泰預計，第4季客運需求將維持穩健。隨著傳統年底航空貨運旺季臨近，加上第4季市場前景向好，預期貨運需求將進一步增長。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:42:05.199048+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:24:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:57:49.806551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:44.962033+00:00","content_hash":"0e2b3d45b2ad004ffe840697b2e0842a3b7f0aeeb9a472055f3ced90797d2c5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}